                349
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Towards a more equitable international financial architecture system"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                70,
                153,
                687,
                171
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "A Member State-led initiative, through the UN Supported by UN Trade and Development (UNCTAD) as Secretariat"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                92,
                189,
                907,
                205
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The Borrowers' Platform is a dedicated space for developing countries to share knowledge, exchange experiences, and speak collectively and with authority on debt challenges of borrowers. While creditor-led forums have proliferated in response to the growing complexity of the global debt landscape, an institutionalized, borrower-led space has been missing. This gap in the global financial architecture constrains the ability of borrower countries to address systemic and evolving debt vulnerabilities effectively— until now."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                68,
                224,
                926,
                306
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/3a9b68673e6a0bc906712316775425ae74a4caeb7a6c90ead2c709a95e8451d0.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                117,
                332,
                235,
                417
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "I believe the creation of the Borrowers Platform is an essential instrument in order for a change in power relations to be possible in the future, and that changing power relations is absolutely essential to have a fair international financial architecture"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                260,
                336,
                889,
                393
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "UN Secretary-General António Guterres\nApril 2026, Washington DC"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                260,
                401,
                541,
                430
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/afb0350bc362fdb07f784dbecbc77f4b5662071fa2d29a41bb42a3dce520a0b1.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                842,
                376,
                870,
                395
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ">120 Eligible countries"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                92,
                473,
                307,
                494
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "tiers of governance"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                416,
                476,
                554,
                491
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
