                472,
                694,
                493
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Mandatory fees"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                705,
                475,
                816,
                491
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Mandate"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                72,
                520,
                196,
                539
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The establishment of the Borrowers' Platform was agreed under the Compromiso de Sevilla, the outcome document of the 4th International Conference on Financing for Development (FfD4), held in Seville, Spain in July 2025."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                70,
                548,
                478,
                609
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Paragraph 48(i) mandates Member States to establish a borrower platform supported by a UN entity as Secretariat. UNCTAD is supporting the Platform as a Secretariat."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                70,
                613,
                482,
                659
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "How does it work?"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                510,
                521,
                742,
                539
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The Platform is governed at ministerial level by participating countries, supported by senior technical officials responsible for debt. It operates on a voluntary and non-binding basis, open to all net-borrower developing countries regardless of size, income level, or debt profile."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                509,
                548,
                905,
                639
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "As countries learn from each other and share experiences, they will be able to identify common impediments and solutions to debt sustainability."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                510,
                644,
                919,
                690
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Benefits of membership"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                73,
                707,
                359,
                727
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Peer Learning\nPeer learning,\nknowledge-sharing"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                85,
                785,
                194,
                825
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/6400ac6fa822bf4ba84c852bfcbeab0dedd998c0ea2d167827d465b96b069790.jpg"
