                "table_caption": [],
                "table_footnote": [],
                "html": "<table><tr><td>APRIL 2026</td><td>NOW</td><td>OCTOBER 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Launch of the Borrowers&#x27; Platform at the IMF-World Bank Spring Meetings in Washington, D.C., with 30+ developing countries.</td><td>The Interim Steering Committee meets regularly to finalize the Platform&#x27;s Modalities, governance framework, and financing arrangements. Egypt serves as Interim Chair.</td><td>First annual cycle (2026/2027) launches on the sidelines of the IMF-World Bank Annual Meetings in Thailand.First Governing Council convenesAdoption of modalitiesElection of the first country Chair and TroikaAdoption of workplan 2026/27</td></tr></table>",
